
---
import DocsLayout from '/src/layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
import DocsCode from '/src/components/DocsCode.astro';
---

<DocsLayout title="Lua & LSL Docs">
<div class="dashboard summary-function">
  <div class="dashboard-header">
    <span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`ll.OffsetTexture(OffsetS: number, OffsetT: number, Face: number)`} lang="slua" /></span>
    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`llOffsetTexture(float OffsetS, float OffsetT, integer Face);`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>Sets the texture <b>u</b> & <b>v</b> offsets for the chosen <b>face</b>.</p>
</p>
      <table class="param-table" id="parameters">
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>number</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>float</span></td>
          <td>OffsetS / u</td>
          <td>horizontal (x) offset in the interval [-1.0, 1.0]</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>number</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>float</span></td>
          <td>OffsetT / v</td>
          <td>vertical (y) offset in the interval [-1.0, 1.0]</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>number</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>integer</span></td>
          <td>Face / <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Parameters/face" target="_blank">face</a></td>
          <td><a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Face" target="_blank">face</a> number or <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/ALL_SIDES" target="_blank">ALL_SIDES</a></td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Categories</div>
      <ul class="meta-list">
        <li>prim</li>
        <li>prim_appearance</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Tech Specs</div>
      <div class="tech-item"><span class="tech-label">Sleep</span><span class="tech-val">0.2s</span></div>
      <div class="tech-item"><span class="tech-label">Energy</span><span class="tech-val">10</span></div>
      <div class="tech-item"><span class="tech-label">LSO ID</span><span class="tech-val">55</span></div>

      <div class="label-stack">
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
  <p>If <b>face</b> is <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/ALL_SIDES" target="_blank">ALL_SIDES</a> then the function works on all sides.</p>
  <h2>Caveats</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>This function causes the script to sleep for 0.2 seconds.</li>
    <li>The function silently fails if its <b>face</b> value indicates a face that does not exist.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Examples</h2>
<div class="lua-block"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`--Offsets the textures on 6 sides
local offset = 0
local function main()
    local i = 0

    for i = 1, 6 do
        offset = offset + .1
        ll.OffsetTexture(tonumber(offset), tonumber(offset), i)
    end
end

main()
`} lang="slua" /></div>
<div class="lsl-block"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`//Offsets the textures on 6 sides
float offset;
default
{
    state_entry()
    {
        integer i;
        
        for( i = 1; i < 7; i++ )
        {
            offset = offset + .1;
            llOffsetTexture( (float)offset, (float)offset, i);
        }
    }
}`} lang="lsl" /></div>
  <h2>Notes</h2>
  <p>If you use `vector offsetVec = <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlGetTextureOffset" target="_blank">llGetTextureOffset</a>()` to get the vector of the current offset, then `u = offsetVec.x` and `v = offsetVec.y`</p>
